  {
   "id": "t_affcde6eb05e0ba79ecd",
   "sourceHash": "affcde6eb05e0ba79ecd254c2590cc11469b46ba62ab46b18665b92e99c4a1a9",
   "text": "Kairali Retreat 的所有餐食均为素食。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_761697487ad58e106267",
   "sourceHash": "761697487ad58e1062679eeb224def51640177a646e24f4ed88387a00220f9a9",
   "text": "原则上，Kairali Retreat 的建筑物内禁止饮酒和吸烟。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_607a29e7a474904b5169",
   "sourceHash": "607a29e7a474904b5169377757b03096fdfe543ddfa5e1b4c24de54685b2d44b",
   "text": "入住者可自由使用健身房和泳池。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Guests' rendered as 入住者 (people staying) instead of a 'guests' equivalent, per the language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4e025558c97d91ac1ccc",
   "sourceHash": "4e025558c97d91ac1ccc6b67d65c87c0e6257ae08ff7bbefd3de7f992bc068e3",
   "text": "关于阿育吠陀治疗，将在与医生问诊后，根据个人的身体状况确定适合的治疗方案。请注意，餐食、治疗等可能会根据每日问诊情况进行调整。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a086ccb2531502fe373",
   "sourceHash": "7a086ccb2531502fe37370f8c69bdc9f6deea8fce559a370847ddbbc90f21299",
   "text": "Kairali 意为“源自喀拉拉”。喀拉拉位于印度南部，被视为阿育吠陀的圣地。Kairali Retreat 由 Ramesh 夫妇于 1997 年在喀拉拉创立。Ramesh 家族世代制作阿育吠陀药物。自创立以来，Kairali Retreat 一直提供真正正宗的阿育吠陀生活方式，让世界各地的人们都能体验真正阿育吠陀的显著益处。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ee31f7a18e70d47f8bd6",
   "sourceHash": "ee31f7a18e70d47f8bd6d16f19f15c3cebfca4e9167f801662167f91f8043c4f",
   "text": "“预防胜于治疗”——这是 Ramesh 夫妇的座右铭。Kairali 希望每个人都能过上更充实、更健康的生活，通过融合瑜伽、营养等方面，提供阿育吠陀疗法以及涵盖生活各个方面的理想生活方式。我们诚邀您把握这个机会，探索真正的阿育吠陀生活方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Motto 'Prevention is better than cure' rendered with 治疗 (treatment) rather than a 'cure' equivalent, per the language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_88a516d2f74766e1e12f",
   "sourceHash": "88a516d2f74766e1e12f2c29409c58e69be9abcad2a74faac44154095fdab871",
